    "loaded_posts": [
      {
        "id": 607619,
        "name": "Muhammad Bin Zohaib",
        "username": "Muhammad_Bin_Zohaib",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/muhammad_bin_zohaib/{size}/193744_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-10-30T12:42:45.499Z",
        "cooked": "<h1><a name=\"p-607619-hi-everyone-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-607619-hi-everyone-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Hi everyone!</h1>\n<p>I’m Muhammad, Founder &amp; CEO of <strong>AI Coders</strong>, an AI automation agency helping businesses build AI agents, automation systems, API integrations, and custom software.</p>\n<p>We’re looking to connect with individuals who can help us bring in new clients, projects, and business opportunities.</p>\n<p><strong>To be clear, we’re NOT looking for developers or technical people to build automations.</strong> We already have the technical expertise and delivery capabilities in-house.</p>\n<p>We’re looking for people who can:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Identify businesses that need AI automation or custom software.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Find and connect with potential clients and decision-makers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Generate qualified business opportunities through LinkedIn, email, networking, or their existing connections.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Understand basic client requirements and introduce relevant projects to us.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Help build relationships with businesses looking for reliable technical partners.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-607619-what-we-bring-to-the-table-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-607619-what-we-bring-to-the-table-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><strong>What we bring to the table:</strong></h3>\n<p>We handle the entire technical side, including:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>AI agent development and implementation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>n8n workflows and business process automation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>WhatsApp and CRM automation.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>API integrations and custom software development.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Project scoping, development, testing, deployment, and ongoing support.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Essentially, you focus on bringing the right opportunities, and we take care of turning them into working solutions.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-607619-whats-in-it-for-you-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-607619-whats-in-it-for-you-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><strong>What’s in it for you?</strong></h3>\n<p>We’re open to discussing a commission-based partnership or another mutually beneficial arrangement with the right people. Compensation, commission structure, and collaboration terms can be discussed directly based on your involvement and the opportunities you bring.</p>\n<p>We’re particularly interested in connecting with business development professionals, lead generation specialists, independent consultants, agency owners, and well-connected individuals who already work with businesses and can introduce genuine opportunities.</p>\n<p>We’re looking to build meaningful, long-term partnerships rather than one-off arrangements.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-607619-interested-in-working-together-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-607619-interested-in-working-together-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><strong>Interested in working together?</strong></h3>\n<p>Feel free to reply to this post, send me a private message, or reach out directly:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Website: <a href=\"https://aicoders.dev/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://aicoders.dev/</a></li>\n<li>LinkedIn: <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/mbz1415/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.linkedin.com/in/mbz1415/</a></li>\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:hello@aicoders.dev\">hello@aicoders.dev</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>I’d love to hear from people who can bring the right opportunities. Let’s build something valuable together!</p>\n<p>Muhammad Bin Zohaib<br>\nFounder &amp; CEO, AI Coders</p>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/t/jobs-category-guidelines-posting-and-applying/941\">here</a>.</small></p>",
